# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0061.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
Chat UI -> REST + SSE Router: POST /messages
useSSE Hook -> REST + SSE Router: GET /events?after=N
REST + SSE Router -> SessionManager
SessionManager -> SQLite DB: store events + messages
SessionManager -> asyncio.Event: notify
asyncio.Event -> REST + SSE Router: wake up
REST + SSE Router -> useSSE Hook: SSE stream
SessionManager -> SandboxManager: create / run / terminate
SandboxManager -> agent_runner.py: sb.exec() in thread
agent_runner.py -> asyncio.Queue: NDJSON stdout
asyncio.Queue -> SessionManager: yield events
agent_runner.py -> Claude Agent SDK
Claude Agent SDK -> Claude Model: query + resume
Claude Model -> Read / Write / Edit / Bash / Glob / Grep: tool calls
Claude Agent SDK -> SDK Session Store: session_id
pre-push hook -> agent_runner.py: /tmp/endo-push-request
SessionManager -> SandboxManager: "sb.exec: write /tmp/endo-push-response"
Chat UI -> REST + SSE Router: POST /permission

Frontend (Next.js) { Chat UI, useSSE Hook }
Backend (FastAPI) { REST + SSE Router, SessionManager, SandboxManager, SQLite DB, asyncio.Event, asyncio.Queue }
Modal Cloud Sandbox { agent_runner.py, Claude Agent SDK, Read / Write / Edit / Bash / Glob / Grep, pre-push hook, code-server }
Anthropic API { Claude Model, SDK Session Store }
